{#- Observability lines of every C8000v (ADR 0051): syslog to the lab receiver and SNMPv3 (view + group) in VRF
    MGMT. Included by c8000v.j2 (startup config) and rendered alone by eve.build.render_snippet for the governed
    push; the SNMPv3 user carries passphrases and is rendered only when the play passes them (never committed).
    IOS XE answers SNMP polls arriving on a VRF interface without extra configuration. gNMI: the loaded
    17.13.01a image has no gnxi command (ADR 0051), so the routers are read through SNMP. -#}
{%- set o = lab.observability %}
logging origin-id hostname
logging source-interface GigabitEthernet1 vrf MGMT
logging host {{ o.syslog }} vrf MGMT
snmp-server view {{ o.snmp.view }} iso included
snmp-server group {{ o.snmp.group }} v3 priv read {{ o.snmp.view }}
snmp-server location {{ node.site }}
snmp-server contact itential-enterprise-lab
{%- if snmpv3 %}
snmp-server user {{ o.snmp.user }} {{ o.snmp.group }} v3 auth sha {{ snmpv3.auth }} priv aes 128 {{ snmpv3.priv }}
{%- endif %}
